{"id":"2076281707599245778","kind":"answer","title":"一年的时间能日语能学到n2 级别吗？","author":"Jarrett Ye","original_authors":["Jarrett Ye"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"外语习得","date":"2026-08-27","updated":"2026-08-27","votes":161,"comment_count":21,"minutes":1,"chars":656,"keywords":["Refold","二语习得","沉浸式学习","词句挖掘","口语练习"],"summary":"成绩刚出，答案是可以： 我从 2025 年 8 月底开始学日语，到 2026 年 7 月初 N2 考试前差不多学了 10 个月，也算是满足题目要求了。 简单统计一下考 N2 前我的时间分配： 看番：170 小时（35 部，421 集） 读轻小说：103 小时（9 本，约 90 万字） 背单词+语法：283 小时（8 千个单词…","question_detail_html":"<p>是这样的，我是英语专业，二外选的日语，大三了，面临着考研，但是不愿意考英语，日语呢学的初级，还是比较喜欢，想问问考日语这个方向的话还有一年时间学到n2水平够不够</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/360019109/answer/2076281707599245778","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"EvykNuVO\">成绩刚出，答案是可以：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"750\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"750\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"LQg2tkV6\">我从 2025 年 8 月底开始学日语，到 2026 年 7 月初 N2 考试前差不多学了 10 个月，也算是满足题目要求了。</p><p data-pid=\"uHZVCN6l\">简单统计一下考 N2 前我的时间分配：</p><p data-pid=\"Cljm8H4Q\">看番：170 小时（35 部，421 集）</p><p data-pid=\"12sf4P7y\">读轻小说：103 小时（9 本，约 90 万字）</p><p data-pid=\"VCj3ftVY\">背单词+语法：283 小时（8 千个单词，538 条语法）</p><p data-pid=\"1OvSHHOr\">应试备考：6 小时（考前一个月做了 3 套卷子）</p><p data-pid=\"h3uFYpvm\">总计在 300 天内学了 562 小时左右，平均每天不到两小时，对于上班族来说是差不多能腾出来的时间。</p><p data-pid=\"Zt0YeqP2\">使用的方法是沉浸式语言学习，没看过教材，也没上过网课，具体做法请见这些回答和文章：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2528a7887565a7ec91a1f9b80ea8803f.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"想问一下学日语的大佬，自学日语要怎么学？\" data-tm-id=\"2054997204230842302\" href=\"#/post/2054997204230842302\">想问一下学日语的大佬，自学日语要怎么学？</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ad9fd00d617ba3c3b92524e9c77ef66b.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）\" data-tm-id=\"671671625\" href=\"#/post/671671625\">从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）</a><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-62ee5a7955e0500d683f8200ad3f3364.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"日语学习：萌萌二次元之路\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2005777505055967011\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日语学习：萌萌二次元之路</a><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"‍‌‬‌​​‌​﻿​‌​﻿⁠⁠​​‍​﻿​​​⁠​‬‬﻿‌‍​​​​⁠‌​‬﻿​‌​​​﻿​‍‍‌﻿基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档\" href=\"https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/YeOSwsG7giLuQxkcDFscUXVZn2f\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">‍‌‬‌​​‌​﻿​‌​﻿⁠⁠​​‍​﻿​​​⁠​‬‬﻿‌‍​​​​⁠‌​‬﻿​‌​​​﻿​‍‍‌﻿基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档</a><p data-pid=\"01m_2sJ1\">我每周都会在 B 站发我平时学习日语的过程，仅供参考：</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"[学日语] 无阻沉浸 ニューゲーム S1 (2026-08-23)\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nC8b6hEfU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">[学日语] 无阻沉浸 ニューゲーム S1 (2026-08-23)</a><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"[学日语] 看週に一度クラスメイト買う話第八卷 (2026-08-22)\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1BC8m6VEr9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">[学日语] 看週に一度クラスメイト買う話第八卷 (2026-08-22)</a><p data-pid=\"70u57L7S\">感觉年底可以去考个 N1 试试。</p><p data-pid=\"l_vDE0Gp\">我的日语学习统计信息可以在我的 GitHub 查看：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2806\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2806\"/></figure><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"阅读统计报告\" href=\"https://l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-reading-stats/books_reading_report.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">阅读统计报告</a><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2806\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2806\"/></figure><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"日语挖词时间线\" href=\"https://l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-mining-report/lapis_mining_timeline_report.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日语挖词时间线</a><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2806\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2806\"/></figure><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"日语挖卡报告\" href=\"https://l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-mining-report/lapis_source_report.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日语挖卡报告</a><p data-pid=\"gaS011P2\">还有我的 <span class=\"nolink\">jiten.moe</span> 主页：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1280\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1280\"/></figure><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"Profile - L-M-Sherlock - Jiten\" href=\"https://jiten.moe/profile/L-M-Sherlock\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Profile - L-M-Sherlock - Jiten</a><p data-pid=\"h8ShLmp2\">自学日语，没有秘密，你也可以。</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"671671625","title":"从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）","author":"Refold","votes":758,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"663375434","title":"2B3：自然单语过渡","author":"Refold","votes":40,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Refold"},{"id":"665596235","title":"2C4：结构化单语过渡","author":"Refold","votes":28,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Refold"},{"id":"2002818500717207719","title":"日语学习指南","author":"Shoui","votes":427,"minutes":23,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"585666622","title":"从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（简化版）","author":"Refold","votes":441,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Refold"},{"id":"2003200028689338460","title":"30 天入门日语","author":"UsagiSpoon","votes":254,"minutes":35,"reason":"延伸